                  %mo ,
                  %mi.mathscript 𝒞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \text{Fun}(\mathscr{C},\mathscr{C})
            is a monoidal category, with the monoidal structure coming from composition. Duals correspond to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+functor"} adjoint functor
            as can be stated formally below:
          %p
          .num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
